[00:09.92] You said that you'd come back and start all over
[00:16.20] Our love would be the way it used to be
[00:25.86] But you just want me when there are no other
[00:33.90] You play your game so you come back to me
[00:40.88] The same old memories are back just like they were before
[00:50.10] The same old memories and everytime they hurt me more
[00:58.88] You're happy when my heart is on its knees hurting with the same old memories
[01:14.94] [ Fiddle - steel ]
[02:17.20] The same old memories...
